+---
+id: task-005-create-json-patch-changes
+type: task
+title: "Create JSON Patch changes"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement and export `createPatch(from, to)` to generate an RFC 6902 JSON Patch that transforms one
+JSON value into another without mutating either input. The generated patch must be concise for local
+changes, including nested objects and arrays, and correctly escape JSON Pointer tokens. Add
+deterministic unit coverage for no-op, scalar/root, object, array, escaping, validation, and input
+immutability behaviour.
